1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:09,530
Oh Lord, how many are my foes Many are rising against me

2
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:13,000


3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Many are saying of my soul There is no salvation for him in God

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,400


5
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:38,200
But you, oh Lord, are a shield about me My glory and the lifter of my head

6
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:47,200
I cried aloud to the Lord and he answered me From his holy hill

7
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:54,200


8
00:00:54,200 --> 00:01:44,200
I lay down and slept, I awoke again For the Lord sustained me

9
00:01:44,200 --> 00:02:27,200
I will not be afraid of many thousands of people who have set themselves against me You, oh Lord, are a shield about me

10
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:38,800
My glory and the lifter of my head I cried aloud to the Lord and he answered me

11
00:02:38,800 --> 00:03:30,200
From his holy hill Rise up, Lord

12
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:39,000
Save me, my God You strike all my enemies on the cheek, you break the teeth of the wicked

13
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:45,000
Salvation belongs to the Lord May your blessing be on your people

14
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:53,500

